Hello, all!

I think it would be useful to replace all constants appearing in various
style files with symbolic  names and store their values in separate =
files
(e.g. stylename.val). This will significantly simplify style =
customization
(and, probably, improve performance), since sometimes the only =
difference
between style provided by standard LaTeX and one required by a =
particular
document is e.g. size of space between chapter name and its first =
paragraph.


With best regards, P. Trifonov

